30.205025	  1. Check `pread` return; if < PER_EXPERT, trigger error or re-read.  
30.205038	  2. Add `std::memcpy` `__builtin_memcpy` with non-overlapping check (`memmove`) or ensure `staging` and slot buffers are distinct.  
